    "description": "IHME is part of the University of Washington. \n\nOn June 21, 2026, requests to IHME\u2019s file-sharing service used information returned about a public vaccine-data file to request its protected version history. Arquivo captures preserve the Microlink programs and their returned results.\n\nThe sequence, in UTC:\n\n  \u2022 21:15:22: Metadata for a public vaccine-coverage CSV returned its internal file ID.\n  \u2022 21:17:28: Another metadata response returned the file owner\u2019s identifier.\n  \u2022 21:18:53: Eighty-five seconds later, a new request combined those identifiers to ask for previous versions of the file. The response was HTTP 401: \u201cNo public access to this resource.\u201d\n  \u2022 21:21:50: A retry used the public sharing-link token as a username with an empty password. That also returned HTTP 401.\n\nOrdinary public CSV downloads succeeded later. We found no successful access to protected version history.",
